  "description": "But I'm supposed to make you happy!\n\nDove has always been the black sheep among his fellow Angels-in-waiting. To finally come into his own as an official Angel, he must make his designated human happy. But his assignment, Ye-Na Jang, is a girl who already has it all — except love. Will Dove be able to fulfill her wishes?\n\n(Source: Manta, edited)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter*",
